# Uldaros Theorix: "up to one target nonland card of each card type". Bot1's graveyard holds Ornithopter (artifact creature),
# Urza's Saga (an Enchantment Land), Tarfire (a Kindred Instant), Dark Ritual and three Entombs (instants), and the Black
# Lotus sacrificed to cast him (artifact). The first target question refuses Urza's Saga, which is a land card whatever else
# it is; the Ornithopter - the positive control, offered in the same question - is chosen. It is one target, so the next question does not offer it
# again for its other type (CR 115.3). Tarfire is chosen (it can stand for the kindred), and then Dark Ritual for the
# instant: a Kindred Instant card and an Instant card can both be chosen, since each is a different type. With
# the instant taken, the Entombs, instants too, are no longer offered, and the Lotus still is. Four cards are exiled and cast, all of
# mana value 1 or less; Urza's Saga and the three Entombs stay in the graveyard.

